	(text "CAN1 POWERED: fit JP5 + JP6 together on the can-ssr bus\n(up to 4 can-ssr at ~0.2 A each; F10 2 A hold).\nF10 and JP5/JP6 sit at the RACK | CAN1 boundary on the board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 340.36 78.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cf1df100-9f6c-4675-bcf7-b3a92e94e329")
	)
	(text "JP1-JP4: fit the shunt (Samtec SNT-100-BK-G) only where this card is a bus end.\nD20-D23: CAN activity (lit while RXD is low = bus dominant; RXD echoes our own TX)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 271.78 0)
		(effects
